OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner fails in bid for
OL,4,Astriped front to stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boutique owner says she is "deeply
OL,7,Fdisappointed" after being told to
OL,8,Fremove the pink and burgundy stripes
OL,9,Fshe painted on her historic shop.
OL,11,FIsabella Wookey, owner of Willow & Wolf
OL,12,Fon Marlborough High Street, added the
OL,13,Funique design to her 18th-century Grade
OL,14,FII listed shop in 2025.
OL,16,FWiltshire Council told Wookey to remove
OL,17,Fthe stripes in October 2025; she
OL,18,Fapplied for retrospective listed
OL,19,Fbuilding consent in March.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
