OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner fails in bid for
OL,4,Astriped front to stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting of the council's eastern
OL,7,Farea planning committee on Thursday,
OL,8,Fmembers voted by five votes to two to
OL,9,Frefuse Wookey's consent.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
